# SCSS — Palos de Leños KDS

## Arquitectura de archivos

```
src/styles/
├── _variables.scss      # Tokens de diseño (colores, spacing, tipografía)
├── _mixins.scss         # Mixins reutilizables
├── _animations.scss     # Keyframes globales
├── _reset.scss          # CSS reset
└── global.scss          # Importa todo lo anterior (sin estilos propios)

src/components/<name>/
└── <Name>.module.scss   # CSS Modules por componente
```

## Variables — Design Tokens

```scss
// _variables.scss

// ─── Paleta KDS ──────────────────────────────────────────
$color-bg-dark:        #0d0d0d;
$color-bg-surface:     #1a1a1a;
$color-bg-elevated:    #252525;
$color-border:         #333333;

$color-primary:        #ff6b00;   // naranja Palos de Leños
$color-primary-hover:  #ff8533;
$color-success:        #22c55e;
$color-warning:        #f59e0b;
$color-danger:         #ef4444;
$color-info:           #3b82f6;

$color-text-primary:   #f5f5f5;
$color-text-secondary: #a3a3a3;
$color-text-muted:     #666666;

// ─── Tipografía ───────────────────────────────────────────
$font-family-base:  'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
$font-family-mono:  'JetBrains Mono', monospace;

$font-size-xs:   0.75rem;   // 12px
$font-size-sm:   0.875rem;  // 14px
$font-size-base: 1rem;      // 16px
$font-size-lg:   1.125rem;  // 18px
$font-size-xl:   1.25rem;   // 20px
$font-size-2xl:  1.5rem;    // 24px
$font-size-3xl:  2rem;      // 32px

$font-weight-regular: 400;
$font-weight-medium:  500;
$font-weight-bold:    700;

// ─── Spacing (escala 4px) ─────────────────────────────────
$space-1:  0.25rem;   // 4px
$space-2:  0.5rem;    // 8px
$space-3:  0.75rem;   // 12px
$space-4:  1rem;      // 16px
$space-5:  1.25rem;   // 20px
$space-6:  1.5rem;    // 24px
$space-8:  2rem;      // 32px
$space-10: 2.5rem;    // 40px
$space-12: 3rem;      // 48px

// ─── Bordes y radios ──────────────────────────────────────
$radius-sm: 4px;
$radius-md: 8px;
$radius-lg: 12px;
$radius-xl: 16px;

// ─── Sombras ──────────────────────────────────────────────
$shadow-sm:  0 1px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
$shadow-md:  0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
$shadow-lg:  0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
$shadow-glow-primary: 0 0 16px rgba(255, 107, 0, 0.3);

// ─── Transiciones ─────────────────────────────────────────
$transition-fast:   150ms ease;
$transition-base:   250ms ease;
$transition-slow:   400ms ease;

// ─── Breakpoints ─────────────────────────────────────────
$bp-sm:   480px;
$bp-md:   768px;
$bp-lg:  1024px;
$bp-xl:  1280px;
$bp-2xl: 1536px;

// ─── KDS específico ───────────────────────────────────────
$kds-card-min-width:  280px;
$kds-card-max-width:  360px;
$kds-header-height:   64px;
$kds-sidebar-width:   240px;
```

## Mixins

```scss
// _mixins.scss

// Responsive
@mixin respond-to($breakpoint) {
  @if $breakpoint == sm  { @media (min-width: $bp-sm)  { @content; } }
  @if $breakpoint == md  { @media (min-width: $bp-md)  { @content; } }
  @if $breakpoint == lg  { @media (min-width: $bp-lg)  { @content; } }
  @if $breakpoint == xl  { @media (min-width: $bp-xl)  { @content; } }
  @if $breakpoint == 2xl { @media (min-width: $bp-2xl) { @content; } }
}

// Truncar texto
@mixin text-truncate($lines: 1) {
  @if $lines == 1 {
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  } @else {
    display: -webkit-box;
    -webkit-line-clamp: $lines;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
}

// Flex shortcuts
@mixin flex-center {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}

@mixin flex-between {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
}

// Card base KDS
@mixin kds-card {
  background: $color-bg-surface;
  border: 1px solid $color-border;
  border-radius: $radius-lg;
  padding: $space-4;
  transition: border-color $transition-base;

  &:hover {
    border-color: rgba($color-primary, 0.4);
  }
}

// Estado urgente (orden tardía)
@mixin urgent-pulse {
  animation: urgentPulse 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;
  border-color: $color-danger !important;
  box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba($color-danger, 0.4);
}
```

## CSS Modules — convenciones

- Un archivo `.module.scss` por componente.
- BEM adaptado para modules: `.card`, `.card__header`, `.card--urgent` (las variantes como clases separadas, no `&--`).
- Usar `composes` para reutilizar clases base.

```scss
// OrderCard.module.scss
@use '../styles/variables' as *;
@use '../styles/mixins' as *;

.card {
  @include kds-card;
  min-width: $kds-card-min-width;
  max-width: $kds-card-max-width;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: $space-3;
}

.urgent {
  @include urgent-pulse;
}

.header {
  @include flex-between;
}

.tableNumber {
  font-size: $font-size-xl;
  font-weight: $font-weight-bold;
  color: $color-text-primary;
}

.timer {
  font-size: $font-size-sm;
  color: $color-text-secondary;
  font-family: $font-family-mono;
}
```

```tsx
// Uso en componente
import styles from './OrderCard.module.scss';

<div className={`${styles.card} ${isUrgent ? styles.urgent : ''}`}>
```

## Anti-patrones prohibidos

- ❌ Estilos inline en JSX (salvo valores dinámicos imposibles de pre-calcular)
- ❌ `!important` salvo en la clase `.urgent` y overrides de librerías externas
- ❌ Valores hardcoded de colores/spacing — usar variables siempre
- ❌ Selectores globales en archivos `.module.scss`
- ❌ `@import` (deprecated) — usar `@use` con alias
